.\" SPDX-License-Identifier: Apache-2.0 WITH LLVM-exception
.Dd November 12, 2026
.Dt NOQTIS-CITE 1
.Os
.Sh NAME
.Nm noqtis-cite
.Nd print how to cite the data of a capsule
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.Nm noqtis cite
.Op Fl -format Cm cff | bibtex
.Ar dir
.Sh DESCRIPTION
Prints, from the
.Cm cite
member of the data record of
.Ar dir
.Pq Xr noqtis-data 5 ,
a
.Pa CITATION.cff
(version 1.2.0, type dataset; the default) or a BibTeX
.Ql @misc
entry: title, authors, year, version, DOI, URL and licence.
Add the member with
.Cm noqtis data put Ar dir Cm cite Ar file .
.Sh EXIT STATUS
0 when printed, 2 on a usage error or a record with no
.Cm cite .
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr noqtis-data 1 ,
.Xr nqdcommit 3 ,
.Xr noqtis-data 5
